[
    {
        "content": "<p>I would like to run a tactic that makes new definitions that can depend on section variables.</p>\n<p>As far as I understand the relation between the monads the typical way to run in <code>CommandElabM</code> from <code>TacticM</code> would have to pass through <code>CoreM</code>. However, it seems that doing it naively does not provide access to the section variables. (Indeed, when one inspects <code>Scope</code> the field <code>varUIds</code> is empty when going through <code>CoreM</code>.)</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>Code demonstrating the issue</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elabInCommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Syntax</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">elabCommand</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"#elab_in_command_elab_m\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">elabInCommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elabInCoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Syntax</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">liftCommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elabInCommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"#elab_in_core_m\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">liftCoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elabInCoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elabInTacticM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Syntax</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TacticM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">liftCommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elabInCommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"elab_in_tactic_m\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">elabInTacticM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stx</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">elab_in_command_elab_m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">thmFromCommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hp</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hp</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">elab_in_core_m</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">thmFromCoreM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hp</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hp</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: theorem thmFromCommandElabM : ∀ {p : Prop}, p → p :=</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">fun {p} hp =&gt; hp</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">print</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">thmFromCommandElabM</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">info: theorem thmFromCoreM : sorry :=</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">sorry</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">print</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">thmFromCoreM</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n</div></div>\n<p>Is there a way to make definitions depending on section variables when running in <code>TacticM</code>?</p>",
        "id": 581033369,
        "sender_full_name": "fiforeach",
        "timestamp": 1774250738
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think you are looking for <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Lean.Elab.Command.runTermElabM#doc\">docs#Lean.Elab.Command.runTermElabM</a>, which gives you access to the free variables from the <code>variable</code> commands.</p>",
        "id": 581111384,
        "sender_full_name": "Jovan Gerbscheid",
        "timestamp": 1774272282
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>At least, that is if you are writing a command. Why do you want to add definitions depending on sections variables in a tactic? A tactic should see no difference between a section variable and a normal variable.</p>",
        "id": 581111918,
        "sender_full_name": "Jovan Gerbscheid",
        "timestamp": 1774272391
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Honestly my idea is somewhat dubious. I want load definitions from a file, elaborate them in a tactic and those definitions are allowed to use section variables. In principle I can also load the definitions using a command.</p>\n<p>I was just curious whether this can be achieved inside <code>TacticM</code>.</p>",
        "id": 581142312,
        "sender_full_name": "fiforeach",
        "timestamp": 1774278755
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"1006462\">fiforeach</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/239415-metaprogramming-.2F-tactics/topic/Running.20.60CommandElabM.60.20from.20.60CoreM.60.20with.20section.20variables/near/581142312\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I want load definitions from a file, elaborate them in a tactic</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Sorry, I don't understand what this means</p>",
        "id": 581142653,
        "sender_full_name": "Jovan Gerbscheid",
        "timestamp": 1774278820
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>After thinking more about this I think that a much better way to do what I wanted to do is to modify the goal state as follows. I tried something similar before and was under the assumption that working in <code>TacticM</code> (or <code>TermElabM</code>) wil require manual passing setting up of the section variables.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeFromFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"p → p\"</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueFromFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"by intro hp; exact hp\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myTactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TacticM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ok</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">runParserCategory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getEnv</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeFromFile</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ok</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">runParserCategory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getEnv</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueFromFile</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">elabTerm</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">none</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mkFreshExprMVar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">runTactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mvarId!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">term</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instantiateMVars</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">liftMetaTactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">assert</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`myDefn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">value</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal'</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">goal'</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">intro1P</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">goal'</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"my_tactic\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myTactic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">my_tactic</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myDefn</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>For what its worth my original question boils down to the following example:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Meta</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Command</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Prop</span><span class=\"o\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeFromFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"p → p\"</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueFromFile</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"by intro hp; exact hp\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myTactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TacticM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Unit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">do</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ok</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">runParserCategory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getEnv</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeFromFile</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ok</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Parser</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">runParserCategory</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">getEnv</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueFromFile</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failure</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">typeStx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TSyntax</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"ss\">`term</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">mk</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">valueStx</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">liftCommandElabM</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">elabCommand</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">`</span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">command</span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myTheorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">typeStx</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">$</span><span class=\"n\">valueStx</span><span class=\"o\">))</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">elab</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"my_tactic\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">tactic</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myTactic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">example</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">→</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">my_tactic</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">myTheorem</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I do understand that this is makes little sense, but that's what I imagined would be the easiest.</p>\n<p>Thanks for pointing out that it <em>should</em> work in a tactic.</p>",
        "id": 581172027,
        "sender_full_name": "fiforeach",
        "timestamp": 1774285110
    }
]